      "person_id": "sn4_yf4_esv",
      "source_quote": "軌棄城走，恩追至襄陽，宗之奔羌，恩與諸將追討至魯陽關乃還。",
      "reading": "追至襄陽、魯陽關。",
      "note": "追至襄陽、魯陽關。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-kuaien:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 203,
      "end_codepoint": 232,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-kuaien:received_sentence4-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "sn4_yf4_esv",
      "source_quote": "恩自從征討，每有危急，輒率先諸將，常陷堅破陣，不避艱嶮。",
      "reading": "每危急時率先諸將。",
      "note": "每危急時率先諸將。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-kuaien:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 28,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-kuaien:received_sentence4-28",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "sn4_yf4_esv",
      "source_quote": "凡百餘戰，身被重創。",
      "reading": "傳稱百餘戰、多重創。",
      "note": "傳稱百餘戰、多重創。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-kuaien:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 28,
      "end_codepoint": 38,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-kuaien:received_sentence4-38",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "sn4_yf4_esv",
      "source_quote": "高祖錄其前後功勞，封新寧縣男，食邑五百戶。",
      "reading": "封新寧縣男，食邑五百戶。",
      "note": "封新寧縣男，食邑五百戶。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-kuaien:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 38,
      "end_codepoint": 59,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-kuaien:received_sentence4-59",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "sn4_yf4_esv",
      "source_quote": "高祖世子為征虜將軍，恩以大府佐領中兵參軍，隨府轉中兵參軍。",
      "reading": "劉裕世子為征虜將軍，恩領中兵參軍。",
      "note": "劉裕世子為征虜將軍，恩領中兵參軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-kuaien:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 59,
      "end_codepoint": 88,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-kuaien:received_sentence4-88",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "sn4_yf4_esv",
      "source_quote": "高祖北伐，留恩侍衞世子，命朝士與之交。",
      "reading": "北伐時留恩侍衞世子。",
      "note": "北伐時留恩侍衞世子。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-kuaien:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 88,
      "end_codepoint": 107,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-kuaien:received_sentence4-107",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "sn4_yf4_esv",
      "source_quote": "恩益自謙損，與人語常呼官位，而自稱為鄙人。",
      "reading": "自稱鄙人。",
      "note": "自稱鄙人。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-kuaien:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 107,
      "end_codepoint": 128,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-kuaien:received_sentence4-128",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "sn4_yf4_esv",
      "source_quote": "撫待士卒，甚有紀綱，眾咸親附之。",
      "reading": "士卒親附。",
      "note": "士卒親附。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-kuaien:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 128,
      "end_codepoint": 144,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-kuaien:received_sentence4-144",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "sn4_yf4_esv",
      "source_quote": "遷諮議參軍，轉輔國將軍、淮陵太守。",
      "reading": "遷諮議、輔國、淮陵太守。",
      "note": "遷諮議、輔國、淮陵太守。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-kuaien:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 144,
      "end_codepoint": 161,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-kuaien:received_sentence4-161",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "sn4_yf4_esv",
      "source_quote": "世子開府，又為從事中郎，轉司馬，將軍、太守如故。",
      "reading": "世子開府，恩後任從事中郎、司馬。",
      "note": "世子開府，恩後任從事中郎、司馬。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-kuaien:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 161,
      "end_codepoint": 185,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-kuaien:received_sentence5-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "sn4_yf4_esv",
      "source_quote": "入關迎桂陽公義真。",
      "reading": "入關迎桂陽公義真。",
      "note": "入關迎桂陽公義真。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-kuaien:p005",
